      *> Parts, labour, services and add-ons with their own price in each currency. The currency is part of the key, so a BRL row and an EUR row are different records and are never converted into each other. CAT-KIND is P part, S service, A add-on or L labour rate per hour.
       FD  CATALOG-FILE
           RECORD CONTAINS 74 CHARACTERS.
           01 CATALOG-RECORD.
               05 CAT-KEY. *> Primary key: currency then code
                   10 CAT-CURRENCY PIC X(3). *> BRL or EUR
                   10 CAT-CODE PIC X(12).
               05 CAT-KIND PIC X(1). *> P, S, A or L
               05 CAT-NAME PIC X(40).
               05 CAT-PRICE PIC 9(7)V99. *> Unit price in the row's own currency, without tax
               05 CAT-HOURS PIC 9(3)V99. *> Standard labour hours for a service
               05 CAT-TAX-RATE PIC 9(2)V99. *> Tax rate in percent for this row's currency
